",\\\"p\\\",\\\"6\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Directions: The nearest railway station is Swaroopganj, 5 kilometers away. Bus service and private vehicles are available from here. Vehicles are also available from Mahavir Bhavan in Swaroopganj. Dharmashala and bhojanshala facilities are available here, though it is better to stay in Swaroopganj.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"7\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Scripture References: This temple is mentioned in the \\\\\\\"Kachholi Ras,\\\\\\\" the \\\\\\\"Mangal Kalash Chaupai,\\\\\\\" the \\\\\\\"Shri Parshwanath Nammala,\\\\\\\" the \\\\\\\"135 Shri Parshwanath Stavan,\\\\\\\" and others.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"8\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Praise (Stuti): Where the Rao of Kutch established the settlement of Kachholi, there the Lord Parshwa was enshrined, taking the name Kachholi; O Kachholi Parshwa, sever the bonds of karma from this worldly existence. \\\\\\\"With devotion I bow to Shri Kachchhulika Parshwa.\\\\\\\"\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"9\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Chanting Mantra: \\\\\\\"Om Hrim Arham Shri Kachchhulika Parshwanathaya Namah.\\\\\\\"\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"10\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Trust: Shri Kachholi Jain Sangh, Post: Kachholi-307023, Station: Swaroopganj, Tehsil: Pindwara, District: Sirohi, State: Rajasthan, India. Phone: 02971-292512, Mobile: 09587225883.\\\"}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1e:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"nav\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-14 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-sandstone-deep/60 pt-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L5\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/en/tirtha/tirtha-094\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"group flex items-center gap-1.5 font-ui text-sm text-ink-soft hover:text-maroon transition-colors\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L1a\\\",null,{\\\"ref\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"iconNode\\\":[[\\\"path\\\",{\\\"d\\\":\\\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\\\",\\\"key\\\":\\\"1wnfg3\\\"}]],\\\"className\\\":\\\"lucide-chevron-left h-4 w-4\\\